      "title": "The Taste of Tea - Wikipedia",
      "snippet": "The Taste of Tea (Japanese: 茶の味, Hepburn: Cha no Aji) is a 2004 Japanese comedy drama fantasy film written and directed by Katsuhito Ishii. Described as a \"surreal\" version of Ingmar Bergman 's Fanny and Alexander (1982), it follows the daily lives of a family living in rural Tochigi prefecture, north of Tokyo.",
